# Anchored to the build root, so the line above does NOT cover site/infra —
# verified, not assumed. The gateway serves site/ (see COPY in the Dockerfile),
# and site/infra holds the landing page's own CDK app, which no runtime image
# needs. The HTTP handler already refuses it twice over (`.py` is not in
# SITE_ASSET_TYPES and `infra` is not in SITE_ASSET_DIRS); keeping it out of the
# image means not relying on those checks to protect something never shipped.
site/infra/
